                            </p>
                            <div style="color: #cbd5e1 !important; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;">
                                <div><strong style="color: #ffffff;">Evolars LTDA</strong> • CNPJ: 62.014.621/0001-81</div>
                                <div>Atendimento Internacional: São Paulo - SP (Brasil) • Luanda (Angola)</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Coluna 2: Cursos e Modo Offline -->
                        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                            <h6 class="text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-size: 13px;">
                                Aprendizado &amp; Offline
                            </h6>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                                <li><a href="/slides"><i class="fa fa-book me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>Portal de Cursos</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/slides/all"><i class="fa fa-list me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>Catálogo Completo</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/slides/offline" class="fw-bold" style="color: #fef08a !important;"><i class="fa fa-bolt me-2" style="color: #facc15;"></i>Cursos Salvos (Modo Offline)</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/slides/all/tag/ciberseguranca-6"><i class="fa fa-shield me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>Cibersegurança</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/slides/all/tag/engenharia-de-software-5"><i class="fa fa-code me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>Engenharia de Software</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/slides/all/tag/qa-automacao-de-testes-4"><i class="fa fa-check-circle me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>QA &amp; Testes</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Coluna 3: Contatos Oficiais Evolars -->
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12">
                            <h6 class="text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-size: 13px;">
                                Contatos &amp; Atendimento
                            </h6>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                                <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <a href="https://wa.me/5511930680941?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+falar+com+a+Evolars+Angola" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fw-bold" style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                                        <i class="fa fa-whatsapp fa-lg me-2" style="color: #4ade80;"></i>+55 (11) 93068-0941
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <a href="mailto:angola@evolars.com.br">
                                        <i class="fa fa-envelope me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>angola@evolars.com.br
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <a href="mailto:contato@evolars.com.br">
                                        <i class="fa fa-envelope me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>contato@evolars.com.br
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <a href="https://evolars.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                                        <i class="fa fa-globe me-2" style="color: #60a5fa;"></i>evolars.com.br
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                                <a href="https://wa.me/5511930680941?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+falar+com+a+Evolars+Angola" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-semibold" style="background-color: #15803d; border-color: #15803d; color: #ffffff;">
                                    <i class="fa fa-whatsapp me-1"></i> WhatsApp Oficial
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://evolars.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light fw-semibold" style="color: #ffffff; border-color: #cbd5e1;">
                                    <i class="fa fa-external-link me-1"></i> Evolars Institucional
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <!-- 7. Copyright Oficial Evolars -->
    <template id="evolars_footer_copyright" inherit_id="website.layout" name="Evolars Angola Copyright">
        <xpath expr="//div[contains(@class, 'o_footer_copyright')]" position="replace">
            <div class="o_footer_copyright py-3" data-name="Copyright">
                <div class="container d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 small">
                    <div>
                        <span style="color: #cbd5e1 !important;">&#169; 2026 Evolars LTDA. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                        <span style="color: #cbd5e1 !important;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle me-1" style="color: #4ade80;"></i>Plataforma Otimizada para Angola</span>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/5511930680941" target="_blank" class="fw-semibold" style="color: #ffffff !important;">Suporte</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <!-- 8. Botão Flutuante de WhatsApp -->
    <template id="evolars_whatsapp_floating_btn" inherit_id="website.layout" name="Evolars WhatsApp Floating Button">
        <xpath expr="//body" position="inside">
            <a href="https://wa.me/5511930680941?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+estou+acessando+a+plataforma+Evolars+Angola"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
               class="evolars-whatsapp-floating"
               aria-label="Fale conosco no WhatsApp"
               title="Falar com a Evolars no WhatsApp (+55 11 93068-0941)">
                <i class="fa fa-whatsapp"></i>
                <span class="d-none d-sm-inline ms-1">WhatsApp</span>
            </a>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <!-- 9. Página Biblioteca de Cursos Salvos (/slides/offline) -->
    <template id="offline_library_template" name="Meus Cursos Salvos (Offline)">
        <t t-call="website.layout">
            <div id="wrap" class="container py-5">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 pb-3 border-bottom">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="mb-1 font-weight-bold" style="color: #0f172a;">Meus Cursos Salvos (Modo Offline)</h2>
                        <p class="mb-0" style="color: #334155; font-size: 1rem;">
                            Cursos armazenados na memória do seu aparelho para estudo sem consumo de dados móveis.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <a href="/slides/all" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-semibold" style="background-color: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff;">
                            <i class="fa fa-book me-1"></i> Ver Catálogo Completo
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="evolars-offline-library-list" class="row">
                    <div class="col-12 text-center py-5">
                        <span class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x text-primary"></span>
                        <p class="mt-2" style="color: #334155; font-size: 1rem;">Carregando cursos salvos no seu aparelho...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
